      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HE'S SAVVY (1) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (22.68) at this track in a Grade 4/5. Lines up from box 1 for the first time. Has a strong winning record at this journey. Overdue and expected to feature again. DOTTIE KEEPING (3) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 3 lengths at Dubbo in a handy 17.97 beating Sky Keeping. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Expected to feature again. AUSSIE GEM (2) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 5.5 lengths seventh (23.06) last time in a Grade 4/5 at this track over 400m. Better than latest and worth another try. SCRATCH DADDY (8) hit the frame latest (22.84) when third at this track in a Grade 4/5. Has two wins already from this draw.",
